{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Ethernet cable is a natural next choice because it could connect my most recent USB-to-Ethernet adapter to a wired network, provided six feet is long enough.",
    "That cable fits the practical connection needs reflected in my earlier WiFi adapter, USB expansion card, and DVI cable purchases."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Buying a headset years ago does not mean I currently need several more headphones or earbuds, especially sports or children's models without a matching need.",
    "The Lenovo power connector requires a specific laptop connection that my history does not establish I have.",
    "The CB radio, door alarm, and shower speaker serve uses I have not shown, while the keyboard offers no clear reason to replace what I already use."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat electronics in general as relevant, even when the devices solve entirely different problems.",
    "My single older headset purchase seems to carry too much weight as a reason to suggest more audio products."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My most recent adapter purchase gives a concrete reason to consider an Ethernet cable that helps me use it.",
    "I buy accessories infrequently, so a clear practical need matters more to me than broad similarity to something I bought before.",
    "Specific fit matters: cable length needs to suit my setup, and a specialized power connector needs evidence that I own a compatible device."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The Ethernet cable connects well to my recent purchase, but most suggestions mistake a history of occasional practical accessories for a current need for more electronics."
}"}
